                                                "sense_id": "64946b4d-ec9c-3e85-a98b-c1f4cd1f5f64",
                                                "text": "Moreover we discuss the reality of self-motions and give a sufficient condition for the design of linear pentapods of Type 1 and Type 2, which have a self-motion free workspace."
                                            }
